  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      245.57,
      401.91,
      270.71
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.91,
      325.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Shop and OfficeEmployees (Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.17,
      401.9,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 18B of the Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration) Act(Chapter 129) is hereby amended by the insertion ofsubparagraphs (c) and (d) of the subsection (2) of that section,as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      424.97,
      401.87,
      463.91
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c)seven days from the date of miscarriage, if themiscarriage occurs in the first twenty eighth weeksof pregnancy; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      480.17,
      401.9,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)seven days from the date of termination of pregnancyunder legal or medical grounds.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      518.57,
      401.9,
      541.91
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
